item.neko_hologram_projector.name=Neko Blueprint Hologram Projector
item.neko_hologram_projector.description.0=Import a controller structure or blueprint and preview its hologram in the world.
item.neko_hologram_projector.description.1=Select world regions to edit blueprints or cut and move complete structures.
item.neko_hologram_projector.description.2=Review materials and changes, then confirm Build, Replace or Dismantle.
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.0=Right-click opens the projector; right-click a real controller to import its structure.
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.1=Without stored cuts: select a blueprint and click Place; Alt-right-click previews the last blueprint.
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.2=Right-click locks the green preview with cyan outlines; right-click again to review materials and confirm in the UI.
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.3=Without stored cuts: Shift-right-click opens Blueprint / Cut; hold Shift and right-click to switch, then release Shift.
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.4=Area: Shift-right-click again finishes, Esc cancels. Locked preview: Shift-right-click unlocks.
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.5=UI: Ctrl-click selects multiple cells, Shift-drag selects a volume, Ctrl+X/C/V edits, RGB axes move.
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.6=Aim at a block to attach; float when no block is hit. Alt forces floating.
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.7=Locked blueprint preview: arrows nudge relative to the view; Alt+Up/Down changes height; hold to repeat slowly, then right-click to review again.
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.8=Moving blueprint preview: R rotates horizontally; Ctrl+R rotates vertically.
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.9=Alt+scroll adjusts floating distance (0–64 blocks, 0 at your feet); ordinary scroll switches items.
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.10=Preview UI: WASD moves the camera.
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.11=Blueprint selection: left/right sets corners; Ctrl adds, Ctrl+Shift subtracts, Ctrl+Z undoes. Cut selection: confirm two corners to store the entire region.
item.neko_hologram_projector.tooltip.12=With stored cuts: right-click opens cut storage; Shift-right-click places; Alt-right-click undoes; Shift+Alt-right-click cuts another region; Alt+A/D switches entries.
